export const STORY_EN = {"child":{"name":"最後火光的孩子","blurb":"一年中最寒冷的那一夜，一個小小的孩子獨自蜷在門口，手裡握著一把要賣的小火光，一個也沒賣出去。為了取暖，她把它們一一點亮。每一朵火焰裡，她都看見了些什麼：一座暖爐、一桌盛宴；最後，是那個唯一曾經抱過她的人，前來帶她回家。","trait":"Starts with 3 Light. The first Fracture of the game is ignored. Never drifts Adrift.","keymem":"The one who always held me, before she left (Acceptance · Person)","threads":["不肯讓火光熄滅，想留住看見的東西","不再等人停下，跟著光走","寒冷與飢餓先被忘掉；對她來說，這也是一種慈悲"],"chapters":[{"title":"The Coldest Night","entry":"It was the coldest night of the year, and the last. She stood barefoot on the street corner, holding a whole bundle of little flames no one had bought. No one saw her.","starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The snow fell harder; one by one the footprints in the street were covered.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"Will she chase after people and beg, or hide?","next":["b1","b2"]},{"k":"g","id":"b1","slot":"Person","text":"I chased after people and begged; every face looked like ＿＿.","next":["f"]},{"k":"g","id":"b2","slot":"Feeling","text":"I hid in the corner of a wall, with nothing in my heart but ＿＿.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"I would not go home; I kept thinking of the time I ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I stopped calling out my wares, and remembered that I too once ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Feeling","text":"I am not so cold anymore; all that is left is ＿＿.","next":["x3"]},{"k":"x","id":"x3","text":"She forgot why she was standing there.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She will not go home, and she will not let go. In the flames she will find somewhere warm."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"She no longer waits for anyone to stop. She strikes a flame just for herself."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"She cannot remember which way home is. She sits down against the wall and strikes a flame."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"沒有人停下腳步","omen":"People hurry past her.","cond":"A Shade enters the soul's space","event":"She holds the flames up higher, and still no one looks at her.","effects":["Obsession ties 2 knots."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"被搶走的鞋","omen":"A boy runs past, laughing.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"Her other shoe is snatched away. The boy says that when he has children, it will make a cradle.","effects":["An unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"第一根火光","omen":"Her fingers have turned purple with cold.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit","event":"A flame flares up, and she seems to be sitting before a great iron stove.","effects":["Gain 2 Light."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"不敢回家","omen":"Home is as cold as the street.","cond":"The Gate is inscribed","event":"She has not sold a single one; her father will beat her. She decides not to go home.","effects":["Place 2 Roots."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"What Lives in the Flames","entry":{"0":"The first flame flares, and she sees a great iron stove. She reaches out her hands, and the flame goes out. She strikes another.","1":"The first flame flares, and she sees a great iron stove. She does not reach out; she only watches, and feels a little warmer.","2":"The first flame flares, and she sees a great iron stove, but she cannot remember how cold she was a moment ago."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What appears in the next flame?","next":["a1","a2"]},{"k":"m","id":"a1","slot":"Place","text":"In the flame appears ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"m","id":"a2","slot":"Feeling","text":"In the flame, I remember ＿＿ again.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The flame goes out; before her is the cold, wet wall again.","next":["p2"]},{"k":"p","id":"p2","text":"One more, and who is it this time?","next":["b1","b2"]},{"k":"g","id":"b1","slot":"Person","text":"In the flame there is ＿＿.","next":["f"]},{"k":"g","id":"b2","slot":"Deed","text":"In the flame, I see myself ＿＿.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Feeling","text":"I strike them one after another, with nothing in my heart but ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"The matches burn out, one after another.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Place","text":"In the last flame: ＿＿, and a falling star.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Person","text":"There is someone in the flame; perhaps it is ＿＿.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She will not let those things leave. Only the last bundle is left in her hand."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"Grandmother used to say: when a star falls, a soul is going home."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"The stove, the roast goose, the Christmas tree vanish one after another. She does not remember that they were ever there."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"烤鵝走下桌子","omen":"On the table behind the window lies a roast goose.","cond":"Any Backlash","event":"The roast goose, a knife and fork in its back, waddles toward her, and then the flame goes out.","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"火光熄滅","omen":"The wind pours in from the mouth of the alley.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"The flame goes out; all that is left is a cold, thick wall.","effects":["River: the 2 Blooms ahead wither.","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"聖誕樹","omen":"Behind a glass door stands a tree hung with candles.","cond":"2 memories on this page are lit","event":"She reaches out to touch it, and a thousand candles rise into the sky.","effects":["River: a Root blooms on each bank of the soul's space.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"流星","omen":"A star streaks across the sky.","cond":"A commission is revealed","event":"She remembers what Grandmother said, and is no longer afraid of the flame going out.","effects":["River: Oblivion ties 2 knots.","Book: light 1 memory for free."],"thread":1}]},{"title":"The One Who Came to Take Me Home","entry":{"0":"She strikes the whole last bundle at once, to keep everything she has seen. In the light stands someone.","1":"She strikes the last flame, unafraid of it going out. In the light stands someone.","2":"She does not know what she is waiting for. The last flame flares, and in its light stands someone."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Person","text":"Standing in the flame is ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The flame begins to flicker, and the face blurs with it.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"To keep her here, I told her everything about the time I ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Place","text":"She says she will take me to ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Place","text":"All I remember is ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What does she hold in the end?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Feeling","text":"I close my eyes, holding ＿＿ in my arms.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Deed","text":"One last time, I ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"Snow settles on her eyelashes and does not melt.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"The snow has stopped. She is lifted up and held tight."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"Dawn is near. The last flame goes out in her hand."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"整把火光","omen":"Only the last bundle is left.","cond":"The soul takes a Fracture","event":"She strikes all the flames she has left, to keep Grandmother here.","effects":["River: gain 4 Light; the Mist advances 2.","Book: if the Key Memory is in any player's hand, that player may inscribe it at once in this page's Person slot (if it is still empty)."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"天亮了","omen":"The sky begins to pale.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"On New Year's morning, people find her in the corner by the wall, holding a handful of burnt matches.","effects":["River: mend 1 Fracture.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"奶奶","omen":"Someone stands in the flame.","cond":"The Gate is lit, and a commission has been revealed this chapter","event":"\"Grandmother! Take me with you!\"","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space, then may move forward 1 more (both must be Lit).","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"再也不冷了","omen":"Her hands no longer tremble.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit, and the forgotten pile has reached 6 cards","event":"Grandmother lifts her up. Little by little her hands and feet grow warm.","effects":["River: remove 1 Scar.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":2}]}],"endings":{"0":{"title":"The Last Flame","text":"She reaches the far shore still holding one unlit flame. The shore-keeper offers her the river's water; she shakes her head: \"I'm keeping it, until she comes.\" She sits on the stone steps of the far shore, and whenever someone crosses, she holds the flame a little higher."},"1":{"title":"Home","text":"She opens her hand, and the flames she had left fall one by one into the river, like a string of tiny stars. The far shore has no doorstep and no snow. She never has to sell anything again."},"2":{"title":"Somewhere Warm","text":"She drinks the river's water. The cold leaves first, then the hunger, then the name of that street. In the end she remembers only this: there was somewhere very warm, and at last she has reached it."},"mix":{"title":"Everything in the Flames","text":"The stove, the roast goose, the Christmas tree, Grandmother: she tells the shore-keeper about each of them, and by the end she has forgotten the beginning. The shore-keeper does not hurry her."}},"fatelines":["她走的，是那一夜替她鋪好的路。","命運一次又一次要火光熄滅，她一次又一次把它劃亮。"],"keylines":["她說出了奶奶的名字，守岸人點了點頭。","她想不起是誰抱過她，只記得那雙手很暖。","她始終沒有說出那個人是誰，好像怕一說出口，火光就會熄滅。"],"hidden":{"title":"New Year's Morning","conds":["The Key Memory is lit and inscribed in Chapter 3's Person slot.","The Book has no Mist scars.","The soul took no Fracture all game (the one ignored by her special rule does not count)."],"text":"When people found her in the morning, she was smiling. They said she had only wanted to get warm. No one knew what beautiful things she had seen, and no one knew that she had walked into the New Year's light together with her grandmother."},"commissions":[{"text":"Help me remember how cold that night was.","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"I want to remember the person I saw in the flames.","cond":"A lit Person"},{"text":"Tell me where I fell asleep.","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit Place"},{"text":"What did the little flames I lit shine on?","cond":"A lit memory from the soul's own memories"},{"text":"Behind that frosted window, whose home was it?","cond":"A lit Place"},{"text":"I want to know how hungry I once was.","cond":"A lit Feeling"},{"text":"Among the things I did, was even one of them warm?","cond":"Chapter 2 has a lit Acceptance memory"},{"text":"In the end, what did I hold as I left?","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Feeling"}]},"garland":{"name":"花環少女","blurb":"一位年輕女子，為她所愛的每一個人都編了一朵花。後來父親死了，那個許諾要娶她的男人變得冷酷，她便將花一朵一朵送了出去，然後仍輕聲唱著歌，滑入了溪水之中。她為自己留下了一朵花，卻從沒有人知道是哪一朵。","trait":"Scattered Flowers: when the soul leaves a space that has at least 1 Bloom, that space may stay as a wall of light; a wall of light with only one Bloom blocks only 1 Fog.","keymem":"The one flower I kept for myself (Acceptance · Feeling)","threads":["等那個不肯回頭的人，唱給不肯聽的人","把花送出去，最後一朵留給自己","歌只剩調子，花不記得是給誰的"],"chapters":[{"title":"A Flower for Everyone","entry":"When spring came, she picked flowers by the brook. For everyone she loved, she would weave one.","starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"Who gets the first flower?","next":["a1","a2","a3"]},{"k":"g","id":"a1","slot":"Person","text":"The first flower, I gave to ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"g","id":"a2","slot":"Place","text":"The first flower, I laid at ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"g","id":"a3","slot":"Feeling","text":"The first flower, I kept for myself, to remember ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"A gust of wind scatters the petals in her basket.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Place","text":"Every day I went to ＿＿, waiting for him to come for his.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"No one ever came for his.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Feeling","text":"With every flower I gave away, I remembered ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Person","text":"I wove a flower, but forgot it was meant for ＿＿.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She hides the loveliest one away, waiting for him to ask."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"She gives the flowers away one by one and keeps none for herself, yet she is happy."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"She weaves so many flowers, but forgets whom they were for."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"迷迭香","omen":"This one is for remembrance.","cond":"A wall of light is left behind","event":"She pins rosemary to her father's coat: \"Remember me.\"","effects":["Untie 2 knots."],"thread":1},{"river":true,"name":"被踩碎的花","omen":"Someone hurries past on the road.","cond":"A Shade enters the soul's space","event":"The flower she wove falls to the ground and is crushed under a pair of boots.","effects":["The 2 Blooms ahead wither."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"草藥的名字","omen":"Her father's voice is slow and gentle.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit","event":"Rue, fennel, columbine. Her father teaches her each one, and she remembers each one.","effects":["Light 1 memory for free."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"沒有名字的花","omen":"There is a flower in her hand, and she does not remember whom she wove it for.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"The flower's colour fades a little more each day.","effects":["Forget 1 card."],"thread":2}]},{"title":"The One Who Pretended Not to Know Me","entry":{"0":"Her father is dead. They buried him in haste, without rites. She stands by the grave, waiting for the man who promised to marry her to come and hold her up.","1":"Her father is dead. She lays all her remaining flowers on his grave, then goes to find the man who promised to marry her.","2":"Her father is dead. She stands before the grave and cannot remember why she should cry."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Person","text":"The day my father was buried, I kept thinking of ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"No stone was set on the grave, and the rain soon washed the earth flat.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Feeling","text":"He said he did not know me. All that was left in my heart was ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I did not run after him. I remembered the time I ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Deed","text":"I think I once ＿＿, but for whom?","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What becomes of the flowers she has left?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Place","text":"I laid all my remaining flowers at ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Feeling","text":"I wove my remaining flowers into a garland, and my heart was ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"The songs she sings begin to lose their words.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She begins to sing, of lovers and of graves, until no one can bear to look at her."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"Carrying the garland, she walks toward the brook, singing."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"父親的墳","omen":"No stone was set on the grave.","cond":"A Grave is turned over","event":"They buried him in haste, without rites and without flowers. She lays all of hers on the grave.","effects":["River: banish 1 Shade.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"他說不認識我","omen":"He walks past right in front of her.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"\"I never promised you anything,\" he says, and turns away.","effects":["River: untie all of Obsession's knots (no Backlash).","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"一首停不下來的歌","omen":"She begins to hum.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"She sings of lovers and of graves, until no one can bear to look at her.","effects":["River: gain 3 Light.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"分花","omen":"She still has many flowers in her hands.","cond":"A commission is revealed","event":"\"There's fennel for you, and columbines. There's rue for you, and here's some for me.\"","effects":["River: Acceptance ties 2 knots.","Book: any player inscribes 1 card from their hand."],"thread":1}]},{"title":"The Willow over the Brook","entry":{"0":"She kept singing that song all the way to the brook. He did not follow.","1":"She carries the garland to the brook, to hang it on the willow.","2":"She does not know how she came to the brook. The song goes on."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Feeling","text":"I hold it to my chest: ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The willow branches hang low over the water.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"When the water rose, I was still ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Person","text":"In the end, I forgave ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Deed","text":"I no longer remember that I once ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"Where does the garland stay?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Place","text":"I hung the garland on ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"The flowers of the garland fall into the water one by one.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Person","text":"I left the garland to ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"The brook bears up her dress; she floats a while, still singing."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"She gives the garland away, then slips gently into the water. The water is cool, and very kind."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"溪水漫過裙擺","omen":"Her skirt spreads out on the water.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"Her dress spreads out on the water and bears her up a while.","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space (even if the next space is not Lit, but it must have no Black Water).","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"折斷的柳枝","omen":"The willow leans aslant the brook.","cond":"Any Backlash","event":"She climbs the willow to hang the garland, and the branch breaks.","effects":["River: the soul moves back 1 space (never back into the fog); place 1 Black Water on the next space.","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"最後的花環","omen":"She weaves her remaining flowers together.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit, and a commission is revealed","event":"She hangs the garland on the willow branch; every flower has a name.","effects":["River: remove 1 Scar; 2 Roots bloom.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"留給自己的那朵","omen":"One flower is still left in her hand.","cond":"Her own memory is lit on this page, and the Gate is lit","event":"She never will say which one it is.","effects":["River: the Mist advances 2.","Book: light 2 memories for free."],"thread":0}]}],"endings":{"0":{"title":"The Unfinished Song","text":"On the far shore she still sings that song. Everyone who crosses can hear it, but no one understands the last line. She is waiting for someone to ask her: whom was that flower for?"},"1":{"title":"The Garland","text":"She puts her last flower into the shore-keeper's cup. It floats once around on the river's water and sinks. She says, \"This one is for me.\" Then she drinks the river's water."},"2":{"title":"The Brook","text":"She does not remember the man, nor her father's grave. She remembers only that the brook was cool, the willow branches low, and that she kept on singing."},"mix":{"title":"A Flower for Everyone","text":"She speaks the memories in the Book one by one, and each one is like giving away a flower. When she finishes, her hands are empty."}},"fatelines":["每一朵花，她都送到了命運指給她的地方。","命運替每一朵花選好了去處，她卻把花送給了別人。"],"keylines":["那一朵花，終於有人知道是哪一朵。","她找遍了手心，想不起自己留下的是哪一朵。","她把那朵花藏在胸口，帶著它渡過了河，沒有讓任何人看見。"],"hidden":{"title":"The Daisy","conds":["The Key Memory is lit and inscribed at Chapter 3's Gate.","The Book has no Mist scars.","Chapter 3 takes the path of Acceptance."],"text":"She meant to give the daisy away too, but in the end she kept it. It was the first flower she ever wove, and the last. The shore-keeper takes the cup and does not let her drink: \"Take it with you.\""},"commissions":[{"text":"Tell me whom I gave my flowers to.","cond":"A lit Person"},{"text":"The song I used to sing, is it still there?","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Feeling"},{"text":"The brook beneath that willow, where was it?","cond":"A lit Place"},{"text":"Why did I come to hate him?","cond":"A lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"Of the flowers I wove, how many do you still remember?","cond":"A lit memory from the soul's own memories"},{"text":"The herbs my father taught me to know.","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit Acceptance memory"},{"text":"The most foolish thing I ever did.","cond":"A lit Deed"},{"text":"I want to leave with a little peace.","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Acceptance memory"}]},"king":{"name":"渡船上的國王","blurb":"一位年邁的國王，贏下了每一場戰役，唯獨輸了最後一場。他最親近的摯友愛上了他的王后，他的同袍從此分崩離析，而他倒在一片親手造就的戰場上。彌留之際，他被安放在一艘黑色的渡船上。他借來的那柄寶劍，從未歸還給它所來自的那片湖水，因此他始終無法安息。","trait":"Mantles cost 2 Light. The player who causes a Fracture loses their Mantle.","keymem":"The hand that rose from the lake and gave me the sword (Acceptance · Person)","threads":["死守王座、防線與那柄劍","原諒，把劍還給湖","忘了自己曾經是王；對他來說，這也是解脫"],"chapters":[{"title":"The Last Army","entry":"He won every battle but the last. At sunset only crows were left on the field, and a crown caked with mud.","starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Place","text":"I stood at ＿＿, counting the living.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"Crows settle on the fallen banners.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"p1","1":"p2","2":"p3"}},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"The line has already broken; how will he hold?","next":["c1","c2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"The line was long broken, but I remembered the time I ＿＿, and would not fall back.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Feeling","text":"I would not take off the crown; my heart held only ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"The last messenger did not return.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p2","text":"The last of the army is going home; what becomes of the crown?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Person","text":"I took off the crown and gave it to ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Place","text":"I sent the last of my soldiers back to ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"p","id":"p3","text":"After sunset, what does he still remember?","next":["e1","e2"]},{"k":"m","id":"e1","slot":"Feeling","text":"At sunset, all that was left in my heart was ＿＿.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"m","id":"e2","slot":"Person","text":"I remember only ＿＿; nothing else comes back.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"He returns to the castle wearing the muddy crown, and forbids anyone to speak of the battle."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"He places the crown in another's hands. The war is over, but one thing is not."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"He returns to the castle and cannot remember how many years he fought; he only feels tired."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"烏鴉","omen":"Black birds circle above the battlefield.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"He stands among the heaps of the dead, counting the living, and stops halfway.","effects":["Place 1 Shade on the next space ahead."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"守住防線","omen":"Shield after shield falls.","cond":"A Shade enters the soul's space","event":"The line was long broken, and still he stood there, letting no one see him fall back.","effects":["Mend 1 Fracture."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"沉重的王冠","omen":"The crown grows heavier every year.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"He takes off the crown and rests it on his knees; for the first time his head feels light.","effects":["Untie 2 knots."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"最後的命令","omen":"The messenger waits for him to speak.","cond":"A commission is revealed","event":"\"No retreat.\" It was his last order, and the last one obeyed.","effects":["Obsession ties 2 knots."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"The Queen and the Friend","entry":{"0":"He clings to the throne as he clung to that long-broken line.","1":"He returns to the castle. It is quiet, so quiet that he thinks of the queen, and of his dearest friend.","2":"He returns to a castle he hardly recognises."},"starts":{"0":"s1","1":"s2","2":"s2"},"nodes":[{"k":"m","id":"s1","slot":"Place","text":"I held fast at ＿＿ and would not leave.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"s2","slot":"Place","text":"I went back to ＿＿, and no one was waiting for me there.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"How does he learn the truth?","next":["b1","b2"]},{"k":"g","id":"b1","slot":"Person","text":"What broke my heart was ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"g","id":"b2","slot":"Feeling","text":"Someone whispered it in my ear. That night my heart was ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The seats around the round table empty, one after another.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"I buried it deep in my heart, and remembered only that I once ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"Brothers in arms split into two sides and draw swords on each other.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"In the end, I ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Feeling","text":"I forgot why my heart broke; all that was left was ＿＿.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"He won the civil war, but lost half his knights and all his friends."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"He forgave them, but too late to tell them. The kingdom has begun to fall."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"He no longer remembers the betrayal, nor the love. He is only tired."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"圓桌的裂縫","omen":"The seats at the table empty one by one.","cond":"Any Backlash","event":"Brothers in arms split into two sides: some stand behind him, some behind his friend.","effects":["River: place 1 Shade on the next space ahead.","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"燒掉的信","omen":"In the hearth lies a letter never sent.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"He wrote a letter of forgiveness, then burned it.","effects":["River: untie 3 knots.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"誠實的朋友","omen":"His friend cannot look at him.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"At last he admits it: his friend loved her more honestly than he did.","effects":["River: a player loses their Mantle.","Book: light 1 memory for free."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"王后的戒指","omen":"She left her ring beside the pillow.","cond":"2 memories on this page are lit","event":"He puts the ring away inside his coat and does not go after her.","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"The Hand in the Lake","entry":{"0":"He drags his mortal wound back to the lake. The sword is still in his hand, and he will not let it go.","1":"He falls on the last battlefield. He knows the sword must go back.","2":"He falls on a battlefield, a sword in his hand, and cannot remember where it came from."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Person","text":"Lying on the black barge, I remembered ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"Mist rises on the lake.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Feeling","text":"I could not bear to let go; my heart held only ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"The knight comes back and says the sword has been thrown away. He knows it is a lie.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"In this life I once ＿＿, and that is enough.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Feeling","text":"All I can feel is ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"Where is the barge bound?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Place","text":"The barge carries me toward ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Person","text":"The one who stayed beside me at the end was ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"The barge sails into the mist, and the shore is lost from sight."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"Three veiled women keep watch over him, silent all the way."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"黑色的渡船","omen":"A black barge comes to the shore.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"Three veiled women lift him onto the barge. He closes his eyes and stops counting his wounds.","effects":["River: mend 1 Fracture.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"藏起來的劍","omen":"The knight comes back with the sword still in his hand.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the second time this chapter","event":"The knight cannot bear to part with the sword, and twice lies that he has thrown it away.","effects":["River: the soul moves back 1 space (never back into the fog).","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"湖中之手","omen":"The lake is as still as a mirror.","cond":"The Gate is lit, and a commission is revealed","event":"At last he describes the hand.","effects":["River: remove 1 Scar; the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"將來的王","omen":"Some say he did not die.","cond":"A commission is revealed, and the forgotten pile has reached 6 cards","event":"On his gravestone they carved: the once and future king.","effects":["River: Obsession ties 3 knots.","Book: light 2 memories for free."],"thread":0}]}],"endings":{"0":{"title":"The Future King","text":"He will not drink the river's water: \"My kingdom still needs me.\" The shore-keeper lets him sleep on the far shore, and promises to wake him when the day comes."},"1":{"title":"The Sword Returns to the Lake","text":"At last he says it: I forgive you. No one hears, but the lake does. He sets down the crown like a heavy stone, and drinks the river's water."},"2":{"title":"A Knight","text":"The shore-keeper asks who he is. He thinks for a long time and says, \"A knight.\" He cannot remember that he was once a king, nor what he lost. It makes him much lighter."},"mix":{"title":"The Round Table","text":"He lays every memory on the table, the way he once sat his knights in a circle: no head, no foot. He sits down and talks with his own life for a long time."}},"fatelines":["他像一名老兵那樣，服從了命運的每一道命令。","他違抗了命運，就像他當年違抗每一個說他會輸的人。"],"keylines":["他記得那隻手，所以記得自己欠了什麼，也記得已經還清了。","他手上空空的，想不起曾經握過什麼。","他始終沒說出劍是從哪裡來的。那隻手，至今仍在湖底等著。"],"hidden":{"title":"The Isle of Apples","conds":["The Key Memory is lit and inscribed at Chapter 3's Gate.","The Book has no Mist scars.","No player lost a Mantle to a Fracture all game."],"text":"The barge does not stop at the far shore but sails on west, toward an island full of apple trees. The three women say his wounds will heal there. Perhaps one day he will return."},"commissions":[{"text":"Where was my last battle?","cond":"Chapter 2 has a lit Place"},{"text":"Did I forgive them?","cond":"A lit Acceptance memory"},{"text":"How heavy was that crown?","cond":"A lit Feeling"},{"text":"Tell me who was ever true to me.","cond":"A lit Acceptance Person"},{"text":"The sword I borrowed...","cond":"A lit memory from the soul's own memories"},{"text":"What did I ever hold?","cond":"A lit Deed"},{"text":"What was I like when I was young?","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit memory"},{"text":"In the end, did I let go?","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Acceptance memory"}]},"bride":{"name":"留在冥府的新娘","blurb":"她死在自己的婚禮當天。她的丈夫走進黑暗深處，想把她帶回人間，卻有一個條件：在抵達光明之前，絕不能回頭。距離地面只剩一步時，他轉過了頭。從那以後，她便一直佇立在陰影裡，思量著該記住他的臉，還是放手讓它遠去。","trait":"Starts with 1 Light. The first time she would Linger in the dark, she does not forget; she is pulled one space back instead.","keymem":"His face in the instant he looked back at me (Acceptance · Person)","threads":["記住他的臉，等他","先放開手","想不起他是誰"],"chapters":[{"title":"The Wedding at Noon","entry":"She was married at noon. The meadow was in full flower, and everyone was dancing.","starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What does she remember of that day?","next":["a1","a2"]},{"k":"g","id":"a1","slot":"Place","text":"We made our vows at ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"g","id":"a2","slot":"Person","text":"I laughed and laughed in the crowd, thinking of ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"Something moves in the grass.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Feeling","text":"As I fell, my heart held only ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"Before I closed my eyes, I remembered the time I ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"He ran across the meadow, too slowly.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Deed","text":"I think I once ＿＿, but I cannot remember which day it was.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She will not close her eyes. She wants to see him one more time."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"She sees him running toward her, smiles at him, and closes her eyes."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"When she wakes, she is already in the dark. She remembers only that it was noon."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"草裡的蛇","omen":"Something moves in the meadow.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"She runs across the grass, and her bare foot steps on a snake.","effects":["Forget 1 card."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"沒跳完的舞","omen":"The music has not stopped.","cond":"A Shade enters the soul's space","event":"The guests are still dancing; she already lies among the flowers, a ribbon in her hand.","effects":["Acceptance ties 2 knots."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"正午的誓言","omen":"Sunlight falls on two joined hands.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit","event":"\"Wherever you are, I will find you,\" he says.","effects":["Gain 2 Light."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"最後一眼","omen":"His face grows farther and farther away.","cond":"The Gate is inscribed","event":"The last thing she saw was him running across the meadow.","effects":["Untie 2 knots."],"thread":1}]},{"title":"The Narrow Stair","entry":{"0":"She waits at the gate of the underworld and will not go in. Then she hears his song.","1":"She walks quietly into the underworld. Then she hears his song.","2":"She walks in the dark for a long time. Then someone calls her name in song."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What comes out of the dark?","next":["a1","a2"]},{"k":"g","id":"a1","slot":"Person","text":"In the song, I remembered ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"g","id":"a2","slot":"Feeling","text":"When I heard the song, my heart was ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The lord of the dead speaks: \"Until you reach the light, you must never look back.\"","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"I could not say a single word; I could only think of the time I ＿＿.","next":["p2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Feeling","text":"I followed behind, and my heart was ＿＿.","next":["p2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Deed","text":"I was only ＿＿, and I do not know why.","next":["p2"]},{"k":"p","id":"p2","text":"What lies at the top of the stone stair?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Place","text":"I saw ＿＿, just on the other side of the light.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Person","text":"I followed behind him, not daring to fall a step behind, thinking of ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"His footsteps slow.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"The light is just ahead. She can almost smell the meadow."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"The light is just ahead. Only one step more."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"他的歌聲","omen":"The sound of a lyre comes from deep in the dark.","cond":"A wall of light is left behind","event":"His song makes the river of the dead stand still, and makes the dead forget to weep.","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"冥王的條件","omen":"The one on the throne speaks.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"\"She may go with you. But remember: you must never look back.\"","effects":["River: the Mist advances 1.","Book: light 1 memory for free."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"窄梯","omen":"A stone stair whose end cannot be seen.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"She follows the sound of his steps upward, stair by stair, unable to say a word.","effects":["River: place 2 Roots.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"差點得救的憤怒","omen":"Her hands clench into fists.","cond":"Her own memory is lit on this page","event":"She hates that narrow stair, hates the condition, and most of all hates this: she almost believed.","effects":["River: Obsession ties 2 knots.","Book: any player inscribes 1 card from their hand."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"The Instant He Looked Back","entry":{"0":"Only one step more. She stares hard at his back. He turns his head.","1":"Only one step more. She watches his back, and her heart is calm. He turns his head.","2":"Only one step more. The one ahead stops and turns his head."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Feeling","text":"As I fell, my heart held only ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I forgave him, and forgave the self who once ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Place","text":"I remember ＿＿, but not who was there.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The light is just ahead, yet farther and farther away.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What does she remember in the end?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Person","text":"I remembered ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Place","text":"I remembered ＿＿, and the sunlight of that noon.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"She falls back into the dark, with nothing left in her hands but that instant."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"She falls back into the dark, with nothing left in her hands but a meadow."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"墜落","omen":"The stair beneath her feet is gone.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"She falls, down into the fog, and her hands can hold nothing.","effects":["River: the soul moves back 1 space (never back into the fog); the Mist advances 1.","Book: if the Key Memory is in any player's hand, that player may inscribe it at once in this page's Person slot (if it is still empty)."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"第二次死去","omen":"Her figure begins to fade.","cond":"The fog is close","event":"She dies a second time. This time, she does not cry.","effects":["River: mend 1 Fracture.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"他的臉","omen":"Does she still remember that face?","cond":"A commission is revealed, and the first two pages have 3 lit memories in all","event":"She remembers that face clearly: frightened, sorry, and a little glad, because at last he could see her.","effects":["River: remove 1 Scar; the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"鬆開的手","omen":"The warmth of his palm is still there.","cond":"The forgotten pile has reached 6 cards, and the first two pages have 4 lit memories in all","event":"She feels his hand let go.","effects":["River: untie 3 knots.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":1}]}],"endings":{"0":{"title":"His Face","text":"On the far shore she turns around and looks back the way she came. She will remember his face, so that when he comes next time she will be the first to know him."},"1":{"title":"Letting Go","text":"She gives that face back to the river. \"Go,\" she says, whether to him or to herself she does not know. Then she drinks from the shore-keeper's cup."},"2":{"title":"A Stranger","text":"The shore-keeper asks whether anyone is waiting for her. She thinks, and shakes her head. Long afterward, a man carrying a lyre crosses the river; she walks past him without stopping."},"mix":{"title":"The Last Step","text":"She stands on the far shore as if on the last step of that narrow stair: light on one side, him on the other. This time, no one forbids her to look back."}},"fatelines":["她走的，是命運替她鋪好的路。","命運要她往東，她偏偏往西，一次又一次。"],"keylines":["她記得他回頭的那一瞬間，也終於明白了那一瞬間的意思。","她記得有人回過頭，卻想不起那張臉。","她始終沒有說出他回頭時的表情，那是她留給自己的。"],"hidden":{"title":"Never Looking Back","conds":["No card was forgotten to Lingering all game (the first time a card is forgotten to Lingering, turn the Soul card upside down as a reminder).","The Key Memory is lit."],"text":"This time it is she who walks ahead. She never stops, never once looks back, and walks all the way into the light. He follows behind; she knows."},"commissions":[{"text":"Let me remember his face.","cond":"A lit Person"},{"text":"Let me let go.","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Acceptance memory"},{"text":"Where were we married?","cond":"A lit Acceptance memory"},{"text":"That narrow, narrow stair.","cond":"A lit Obsession Place"},{"text":"Am I angry with him?","cond":"A lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"The last warmth of his hand.","cond":"A lit memory from the soul's own memories"},{"text":"The road I walked behind him.","cond":"Chapter 2 has a lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"Before the wedding, who was I?","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit memory"}]},"open":{"name":"無名渡河","blurb":"一個無名的亡魂。你們不會得知它的故事，而是要親手寫下它。","trait":"Starts with 2 Light. Uses the 8 Echo cards; no Key Memory.","keymem":null,"threads":["決定「這就是我」","讓空白的地方空著","讓名字隨河水流走"],"chapters":[{"title":"Who I Was","entry":"A nameless soul wakes on the near shore, with no coin in its pocket.","starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What does it remember first?","next":["b1","b2"]},{"k":"g","id":"b1","slot":"Place","text":"I was born near ＿＿.","next":["f"]},{"k":"g","id":"b2","slot":"Person","text":"I loved ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"Someone in the fog is calling a name, not its own.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"I once ＿＿, and never would forget it.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I once ＿＿, and that is enough.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Feeling","text":"All that is left is ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"Another memory is carried off by the river.","next":["o3"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"It holds on to these few memories and will not let them sink."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"It is in no hurry to remember. However much comes back is how much there is."},{"k":"o","id":"o3","text":"It does not even know what it has forgotten."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"不肯收錢的擺渡人","omen":"A boat glides past it.","cond":"The fog is close","event":"The old ferryman glances at it and shakes his head.","effects":["Obsession ties 2 knots."],"thread":0},{"river":true,"name":"消失的腳印","omen":"Behind it, all is quiet.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"It looks back; one by one the footprints behind it vanish.","effects":["Forget 1 card."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"窗邊的燈","omen":"Far away there is a speck of light.","cond":"1 memory on this page is lit","event":"One lamp has not gone out yet, as if waiting for someone to come home.","effects":["Gain 2 Light."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"愛過的人","omen":"It seems to be looking for someone.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"It remembers that it once loved someone, but cannot remember the face.","effects":["Place 2 Roots."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"What I Did","entry":{"0":"The memories it holds grow heavier, but it will not let go.","1":"It is in no hurry, and walks on step by step.","2":"Another memory is carried off by the river; it does not even know what it was."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Place","text":"At ＿＿,","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"There is the shadow of a bridge on the river.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"I ＿＿, and never regretted it.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I ＿＿, and then let it go.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Feeling","text":"All I remember is ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"Whom was it for?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Person","text":"It was for ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Feeling","text":"The price was ＿＿.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"It remembers a bridge, but not what was at its far end.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"It remembers that person, but not whether that person forgave it."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"What did it do? It can no longer say; it only remembers that it was heavy."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"每天走過的橋","omen":"There is the shadow of a bridge on the river.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"It remembers a bridge, but not what was at its far end.","effects":["River: the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":2},{"river":true,"name":"挑水","omen":"There are marks of a carrying pole on its shoulders.","cond":"A wall of light is left behind","event":"It once carried water for someone, and never heard a word of thanks.","effects":["River: untie 2 knots.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"雪中的栗子","omen":"The air smells of roasting chestnuts.","cond":"The Gate is lit","event":"An old woman presses hot chestnuts into its hands.","effects":["River: Oblivion ties 2 knots.","Book: light 1 memory for free."],"thread":1},{"river":false,"name":"欠下的債","omen":"It feels that something is missing.","cond":"A commission is revealed","event":"It remembers that it owes someone something, still unpaid.","effects":["River: Obsession ties 2 knots.","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":0}]},{"title":"What I Hold","entry":{"0":"It holds tight to everything it has found again. The far shore is just ahead.","1":"It has not remembered much, but it is enough. The far shore is just ahead.","2":"It can no longer tell which memories are its own and which are someone else's. The far shore is just ahead."},"starts":{},"nodes":[{"k":"g","id":"a","slot":"Feeling","text":"All I hold is ＿＿.","next":["x1"]},{"k":"x","id":"x1","text":"The other side of the fog is bright.","next":["f"]},{"k":"f","id":"f","next":{"0":"c1","1":"c2","2":"c3"}},{"k":"m","id":"c1","slot":"Deed","text":"But I will never forget the day I ＿＿.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c2","slot":"Deed","text":"I once ＿＿, and that is enough.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"m","id":"c3","slot":"Place","text":"Even ＿＿ is slowly fading.","next":["x2"]},{"k":"x","id":"x2","text":"It reads the words in the Book as if reading someone else's story.","next":["p1"]},{"k":"p","id":"p1","text":"What is it leaving?","next":["d1","d2"]},{"k":"m","id":"d1","slot":"Place","text":"Now I leave, and leave behind ＿＿.","next":["o1"]},{"k":"m","id":"d2","slot":"Person","text":"Now I leave, and forgive ＿＿.","next":["o2"]},{"k":"o","id":"o1","text":"It closes the Book and walks into the light."},{"k":"o","id":"o2","text":"It looks back once, then walks into the light."}],"fates":[{"river":true,"name":"彼岸的燈火","omen":"The other side of the fog is bright.","cond":"The soul takes a Fracture","event":"There is light on the far shore, brighter than any lamp it remembers.","effects":["River: mend 1 Fracture; the Mist advances 2.","Book: forget 1 card."],"thread":1},{"river":true,"name":"一個名字","omen":"Someone is calling.","cond":"The soul Lingers for the first time this chapter","event":"Someone calls a name; it is not sure whether it is its own.","effects":["River: place 1 Black Water on the next space.","Book: Recall once for free."],"thread":2},{"river":false,"name":"寫下的一生","omen":"The words in the Book begin to feel familiar.","cond":"The Gate is lit, and a commission is revealed","event":"It reads the words in the Book, and recognises itself.","effects":["River: remove 1 Scar; the soul moves forward 1 space.","Book: an unlit memory on this page is forgotten."],"thread":0},{"river":false,"name":"空白的一頁","omen":"One slot has stayed empty all along.","cond":"A commission is revealed, and the forgotten pile has reached 6 cards","event":"It decides to leave that slot empty.","effects":["River: untie 3 knots.","Book: forget 2 cards."],"thread":1}]}],"endings":{"0":{"title":"This Is Me","text":"The shore-keeper asks who it is. It reads every memory in the Book aloud: \"These are me.\" It will not leave out a single word."},"1":{"title":"Enough","text":"It has not remembered much, but it feels it is enough. It closes the Book, hands it to the shore-keeper, and drinks the river's water."},"2":{"title":"The River's Water","text":"Halfway through reading the Book aloud, it forgets the beginning. The shore-keeper does not wait for it to finish. The river's water is very gentle."},"mix":{"title":"Someone Else's Story","text":"It reads the memories in the Book; some seem its own, some someone else's. Perhaps every soul is pieced together like this."}},"fatelines":["它順著河水，走完了別人替它寫好的路。","它把命運寫好的句子劃掉，改成了自己的。"],"keylines":[],"hidden":{"title":"A Name","conds":["Every memory slot on the three chapters' routes is filled, and all are lit.","The Book has no Mist scars.","At least one of the three chapters defied its fate."],"text":"The shore-keeper asks who it is. It opens the Book, reads it through word by word, and then speaks a name. It is one it wrote itself."},"commissions":[{"text":"Whom did they once love?","cond":"A lit Person"},{"text":"What could they not let go of, in the end?","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"Where did they come from?","cond":"Chapter 1 has a lit Place"},{"text":"What did they do that made them proud?","cond":"A lit Deed"},{"text":"What were they afraid of?","cond":"A lit Feeling"},{"text":"Where did they once find peace?","cond":"A lit Place"},{"text":"Did they ever regret anything?","cond":"Chapter 2 has a lit Obsession memory"},{"text":"What do they carry across the river?","cond":"Chapter 3 has a lit Acceptance memory"}]}};
